id: pm-gh1370
title: "GH-1370: validate transaction previews against staged lifecycle state"
description: "Implement existing https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1370. Share lifecycle validation through isolated staged state while preserving original tracker data and actual commit concurrency checks."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-01T10:36:55.000Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T04:57:35.367Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-02T04:57:34.218Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-02T04:57:34.218Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Invalid enums and missing IDs refuse previews with apply-compatible diagnostics;Strict completion validates staged evidence;Preview changes no source items history or journals;Existing rollback and replay controls remain green
parent: pm-y9hq
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Preview runs ordered mutation semantics through the real lifecycle coordinator on a consistent staged snapshot, suppressing original mutation hooks and writes. Durable regular files hash through bounded streams; prepared interior links and special entries refuse before traversal or streaming, and disappeared entries return retryable snapshot conflicts while persistent native path errors are preserved."
expected_result: Invalid plans refuse with apply-compatible diagnostics; ordered staged evidence validates without original mutation hooks or writes; prepared interior links and special files refuse before traversal or streaming
actual_result: "Canonical snapshot/semantic receipt test-local-muq2ve7e-4du2ny passes 20 cases, including three identical pre-fix filesystem failures, links, cycles, sockets, FIFO substitution, bounded large-file final-byte changes, empty files and selected root links. Apply revalidates actual state; normal permitted extension activation can precede staged hook suppression. Final source 92cff9ef184f8b6e932afccc999b24c86f070c30: full-source producing receipt test-local-muq885vf-vje4y3 on canonical owner pm-gh1364 passes 9501 tests with zero failures and 2 Windows-only skips. Its fifteen observed metrics record all four exact 100-percent coverage gates and integer totals; summary SHA256 70cc18dc59614d3a42993046ce1f454131daa8f92f4133fb363abad0132167f0. Complete pnpm quality:static passes test-local-muq8lpre-ketrg6 on supported Node 22.21.1 with unchanged ceilings. Focused lint, four type configurations and SDK import-boundary checks pass test-local-muq6r2d8-g2xkay. Earlier failed runs remain failed without measurements. Final hosted/provider review and independent merge clearance remain pending; live telemetry and opt-in semantic dogfood are unrun. Final test-only typing correction passes canonical receipt test-local-muqhp1g1-rx5nbb, ESLint, all four type configurations, docstring gate and byte-identical TypeScript emit; production source remains unchanged. Final published-head checks and review remain pending."
