comments[16]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T11:18:02.965Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Semantic preview regression checks now pass: invalid risk/status/missing-target refusal parity, strict completion after staged evidence, no source writes, no mutation hooks, committed-plan replay/mismatch, and revalidation after a subsequent deletion. Public SDK/MCP and CLI routes share the disposable transaction coordinator."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T12:44:38.312Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Explicit-cwd MCP dry-run nested activation deadlock fixed by isolating disabled nested registries while retaining the caller activation gate. The real MCP regression passes and preview leaves source durable state unchanged. Shared adapter author resolution avoids divergent preview/apply precedence. Focused checks pass; final all-source coverage and aggregate gates remain pending.
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T15:01:59.949Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final packed invalid-plan preview/apply parity and structured operation evidence pass. Core semantic/staged-state/no-source-writes/explicit-cwd/replay controls passed linked and complete coverage runs; migration and all-source gates pass. Post-close graph, record-integrity and tracker-context assurance pass. Hosted checks and PR review remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T15:32:46.817Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Added structured gate evidence for staged semantic preview negative controls. Prior static success preceded closure and missed the terminal-only defect evidence requirement; final static and post-close defect gates will rerun with unchanged policy.
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T17:59:44.836Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Cubic review correction: content fingerprints before/after copy and on staged bytes refuse inconsistent snapshots without source locks. Both controlled-copy negative controls returned validated:true before the fix and now reject with conflict. Nested disabled scopes discover selected-tracker context intents without reacquiring activation gates. Focused affected suites, lint, and all four type configurations pass. Broad aggregate verification is pending; this item remains in_progress and live telemetry is paused awaiting explicit approval."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:31:00.777Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Snapshot regression moved to tests/unit/sdk/transactions/preview-snapshot.spec.ts to preserve the existing 120-file directory cap. Controlled-copy and directory-cap tests pass in a temporary network namespace. Updated generated refusal census, additive SDK error discovery and active-item changelog; thresholds and public guarantees unchanged. Shared full-source coverage remains pending."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:58:26.420Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Review corrections verified: durable files hash through 64 KiB streams; source files disappearing after the initial root check report transaction_preview_snapshot_changed (exit 4), while initial missing-root and unrelated permission errors retain their existing semantics. The identical pre-fix regression failed three cases; passing canonical receipt test-local-mupwc030-4m1l77 now records all nine snapshot and semantic-preview tests, including a real disappearance and final-byte changes in a 2 MiB fixture. Focused ESLint and all four type configurations pass. Full-source coverage is pending; no source tracker locks or writes and no external telemetry delivery."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T19:40:36.093Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Latest review: preserve ENOTDIR, persistent dangling links, and ENOENT without filesystem provenance instead of labeling them transient. Only an ENOENT whose named entry is still absent under lstat becomes transaction_preview_snapshot_changed. Four new path-error cases fail under the previous catch and pass with this correction; the canonical focused receipt includes them. Strict TOON decode confirms the expanded tests array retains both commands, nested provenance and the optional note; verified PM history has zero errors and current hash equal to the latest history hash. The original history-count observation is preserved in immutable history; the current evidence omits a count that changes as later events are appended. No tracker-format hand edits are appropriate."
    edited_at: "2026-10-01T19:53:37.267Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T19:52:23.727Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "History verification clarification: the cited 45-entry check was a historical observation before the subsequent passing path-focused run and evidence comment added two immutable events. The latest check verifies 47 entries, zero errors, and current_item_hash equal to latest_after_hash. Earlier history was preserved; these counts describe their actual verification times rather than a frozen final count."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T20:35:26.360Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final-source full coverage producing receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e (pm-gh1364) passed on 09ba3c30ec10e637f111b477a46e252b4558d241: 9494 test cases passed, zero failed, two Windows-only skips; exact integer gate passed for lines 63200/63200, statements 66237/66237, functions 13710/13710 and branches 50719/50719. Its canonical passing test_runs row now carries four observed percent gates plus all covered/total dimensions and test-case counts; linked-command passed=1 remains the runner's command count. coverage-summary SHA256=40c980160ae95b9591e5cbb4ac483ee7ca5d42ee7140beb205e2c1e9f38650c6. Measurements were attached only after the actual gate passed using PM's locked test_run_track operation, automatic author and immutable history. Earlier failed receipts remain failed without measurements. This item references the one producing full-corpus receipt through its related edge to the receipt owner; no separate aggregate execution is claimed here. Local static/context/package aggregates and final exact-head hosted/reviewer checks remain pending. No live telemetry delivery or merge performed."
    edited_at: "2026-10-01T20:57:27.465Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T21:13:25.003Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Controlled original-checkout comparison preserved the branch and local main: PR base 89b4aa8bb and checkpoint 2916c6e2f both passed unchanged SDK import ceilings with 15 measured samples. The same ten-sample CLI transport gate failed on both: base get365>362ms, next461>440ms, create419>398ms; head get366>362ms, next451>440ms, create426>398ms. Mixed small changes do not establish a patch-specific regression; the existing local transport admission failure remains a blocker and no budget was weakened. Canonical test-local-muq0nuea-dqzwjn passes graph/record integrity plus bounded mutation (329/336 killed, seven existing equivalents); test-local-muq0up1n-tew4bo passes context relevance, unchanged artifact budget, 89 package-first commands and nine-package npx/Bunx packed smoke. Opt-in semantic dogfood and live external telemetry were unrun. The full static receipt remains failed; no all-static-passed claim is made. Current coverage/focused/type receipts remain valid for unchanged implementation source. Merge awaits final hosted/provider review, resolution of the local timing blocker and independent final-head clearance."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T21:45:15.662Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final local verification: Canonical full-source receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e passed 9494 cases with zero failures and two Windows-only skips; exact coverage lines63200/63200 statements66237/66237 functions13710/13710 branches50719/50719 is recorded on that passing producing receipt. Complete local pnpm quality:static receipt test-local-muq26sl1-rucv2t passed on CI-supported Node24.12.0 with unchanged gates. Focused/type/import-boundary receipts, context/artifact/package-first/npx-Bunx receipt test-local-muq0up1n-tew4bo and bounded mutation329/336 with seven existing equivalents pass. Node26 timing receipts remain failed; matched base/current both failed the same transport ceilings, and changing only to supported Node24 passed them. Implementation source is unchanged. Final hosted/provider review and independent merge clearance remain pending; live telemetry and opt-in semantic dogfood unrun."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T22:12:21.451Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Fresh CodeRabbit top-level security architecture concern is valid despite zero actionable inline comments. The unchanged source incorrectly validated real external file and directory links; a real Unix socket leaked ENXIO. The same regressions now pass with a regular-file/directory policy, rejection of interior links and special entries, no dereferenced copies, O_NOFOLLOW/O_NONBLOCK descriptor opens and reads bounded to observed file size. Explicit root links establish their resolved selected boundary; native dangling-link and persistent path diagnostics remain. Canonical test-local-muq2ve7e-4du2ny passes 20 snapshot/semantic tests, including a real FIFO substituted after lstat without waiting for a writer. This prevents prepared link/cycle/device/pipe traversal; aggregate work remains proportional to finite regular tracker contents. Fresh full-source coverage and static validation pending before renewed closure."
    edited_at: "2026-10-01T22:36:36.437Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T22:12:24.343Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Removed only the unrelated generated managed-extension timestamp delta after checking all other managed state bytes match the PR base. Item/history mutations and evidence remain canonical PM operations. The preview repair has no extension-manager changes.
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T00:31:54.909Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Shared final-source verification now passes on related canonical owner pm-gh1364: producing receipt test-local-muq885vf-vje4y3 is attributed to source 92cff9ef184f8b6e932afccc999b24c86f070c30 and records 9501 passed cases, zero failures and two platform skips, with all four exact 100-percent coverage dimensions and observed integer totals. The coverage summary hash and fifteen actual measurements are attached to the producing receipt; no focused command is relabeled as corpus evidence. Existing snapshot/semantic receipts and three pre-fix filesystem failures remain independently traceable. Complete final-source static and configured final-head review are pending; live telemetry is unrun."
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T04:57:33.162Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final pre-publication review correction: replaced the newly introduced inline filesystem type import with a top-level type namespace import. TypeScript transpileModule confirms byte-identical JavaScript before/after; production source and its coverage denominator are unchanged. Canonical focused receipt test-local-muqhp1g1-rx5nbb passes snapshot and semantic-preview regressions; focused ESLint, all four type configurations and repository docstring gate pass. Canonical tracker receipt test-local-muqhlhtg-bipsvh passes terminal defect contracts, history/resolution validation, all tracker-context assertions and record integrity. Historical receipt restoration independently matches every latest immutable history state. Final-head hosted checks/reviews will rerun after publishing; no pending checks are claimed passed."
